|type         = Buzzword
|link         = Death#Ways to prevent death when reaching zero health
|image        = Revival icon.png
|description  = A unit that is protected by '''Resurrection''' will enter a revival state and {{tip|dispel}} most {{tip|debuff|debuffs}} upon taking {{tip|death|fatal damage}}. After the state completes, the unit is revived. '''Resurrection''' effects do not count for kills or assists.
|description2 = '''Resurrection''' sources have a hierarchy, and will trigger in the following order:
# {{cai|Chronoshift|Zilean}}
# {{cai|Cultivation of War|Zaahen}}
# {{ii|Guardian Angel}}
# {{cai|Rebirth|Anivia}} and {{cai|Cell Division|Zac}}

'''Resurrection''' will always take precedence over {{tip|zombie state}} effects. Entering '''resurrection''' does not cancel cast times. {{cai|Bailout|Renata Glasc}} always takes priority over '''resurrection'''.
